1. DEFINITIONS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
"Software" means the source code, documentation, and other materials in this
repository, and any modification or derivative work of them.

"Licensor" means codingsh.eth, the copyright holder.

"You" means the individual or legal entity exercising rights under this License.

"Gross Revenue" means all revenue You (and Your affiliates) earn, directly or
indirectly, from any product, service, API, or deployment that incorporates,
embeds, links to, or is derived from the Software — including per-call or
subscription fees charged to users or agents.

"Commercial Use" means any use of the Software by or for a for-profit entity,
or any use that generates Gross Revenue, including operating the Software (or a
derivative) as a hosted or internal service, or redistributing it as part of a
paid or revenue-generating product.

"Non-Commercial Use" means use solely for personal study, evaluation,
research, teaching, or internal experimentation that does not generate Gross
Revenue, AND use by any entity whose total annual Gross Revenue attributable to
the Software is below the Free Threshold.

"Free Threshold" means USD 10,000 of annual Gross Revenue attributable to the
Software, per entity.

"Royalty Rate" means five percent (5%) of Gross Revenue attributable to the
Software, unless a different rate is agreed in a separate written commercial
agreement with the Licensor.

